Z||000011||Little Duce Coupe||10-29-2001||04:26 PM||||How bout us Heinz 57's.<P>I'm a lot of #1.... I would love for my 88 coupe to look like it just rolled off the lot.<P>I'm a little #2.....want my VERY stock looking little coupe to bury any adjacent RX7, made over import and for a real grin....a nova or muscle type car just to see the look on their face.<P>Lastly I am ALL of the family #7... money.. money where for art thou?....ooo in my wifes purse...&lt;slap..ouch&gt; guess those hot new brakes can wait a while longer. sigh....<P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"||||reg||1
